  "model_correspondence": [
    "All local columns are strictly after the exposed anchor. Anchor data R and integer c0 are fixed parameters; sampling continues on all n labels.",
    "anchoredMean is M*prefixMass, where M=R.card, and Legal means this is strictly positive. Empty R cannot satisfy genuine legal join.",
    "InternalHistory stores a labeled cylinder and full future words. History proves equivalence to suffix-only data since the prefix is fixed.",
    "IsPrefix v x allows x=v. Public smoothing only requires the genuine legal join, proving a stronger continuation statement without extra legality of x.",
    "Terminal fallback words have no automatic crossing certificate. Degenerate proves literal deterministic endpoints at the anchor and no genuine pair at d=0.",
    "U02 point-mass constant is 4, so the source coefficient 4*C_hyp is 16. The source Chernoff constant is preserved exactly."
  ],
